{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn8/","title":"상영향 EX-HN8","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 상영향의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"상영향 EX-HN8\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-HN8\n위치\n코연골과 코선반능선이 만나는 곳으로 鼻唇溝(nasolabial fold)의 위쪽 끝 지점.\n취혈\n자침·주의\n斜刺 0.3～0.5寸(向內上方)\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn8/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn8/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn8/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn8/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-hn8/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","last_reviewed":"2026-08-22"}
